  "bindings": {
    "author_context_snapshot_digest": "4dd96473e0c0674dceb1dd5ccd73902d871d93c8cdab8f45614f64535cd434b0",
    "author_context_version": 0,
    "draft_id": "draft-0b595d7c-55a5-49f1-be1d-805134a07d04",
    "draft_revision": 2,
    "memory_version": 4,
    "project_id": "prj-bb9511e2-05b7-4217-9bbf-233833d20b2a",
    "source_revision": 1
  },
  "selected_source_bindings": [
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-0b595d7c-55a5-49f1-be1d-805134a07d04-r2-1",
      "text": "昨日温岚尚未得知银钥匙的用途。",
      "sha256": "d71edf60ed15d4ff1e5b78fe3436b750ce72618b808cd2b2905357b218561c4f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-0b595d7c-55a5-49f1-be1d-805134a07d04-r2-2",
      "text": "今日她读完陈澈的信，才知道银钥匙能打开潮汐档案柜。",
      "sha256": "41c96c66ec39c27477c97b125f46eae2766e676240244fbe12808e6b265c9829"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-b5de0ba1-d163-4063-ba44-e63eb3384bda",
      "chapter_id": "ch-48da9d6c-aba2-4daa-b577-0826df68c48b",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-71d28e69-f9d7-47bd-90a8-50ee65cf54f6",
      "chapter_id": "ch-248b9703-9adb-4ca2-8c9e-02160639aa03",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-d55a6761-0726-401b-9331-2aad3eb58759",
      "chapter_id": "ch-f6d54007-1e7e-40af-8fbf-d08b29d14d91",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-22cb565d-9ddb-465c-b300-f45dfebab2f3",
      "chapter_id": "ch-d863079e-5918-47d6-b2ec-6f8cda63bc75",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-4096332e-8950-401f-a173-4868a160ea9e",
      "source_span_id": "span-b5de0ba1-d163-4063-ba44-e63eb3384bda",
      "text": "廊桥钥匙的含义",
      "sha256": "3d99a1a224bc211b22a638a8f187cd974662fc52736efc569d231bb77aa798ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-d4180bf2-281e-4dae-90a5-01da857d0ff1",
      "source_span_id": "span-d55a6761-0726-401b-9331-2aad3eb58759",
      "text": "温岚",
      "sha256": "2fdb67447992579f8f9f0c751e36d69fbcaba84c43b2318b010edec750ef1c1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-08b883b5-fb33-49dd-a6ca-182329f6d561",
      "source_span_id": "span-aeb54ee6-23a8-459b-b6d0-e45ebf593d4d",
      "text": "第3章 19:20",
      "sha256": "0daa1efb0f5bab6e26354fcc18f5939cfbe755a55b86bc8ea86a6bd5bb5fe3c6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-2a4cbb23-9fb0-45cc-8633-535cd9a98093",
      "source_span_id": "span-d934877e-af7d-49cb-94cf-b2ff651c7800",
      "text": "第6章 21:05 收到三次求救码",
      "sha256": "7556dfa1c21c2596152b98090557914768c4a70b2db0c1c03ce3d6a93349e316"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-7f65843c-0a70-4b0c-812f-5c889d3c727c",
      "source_span_id": "span-ab6c06a0-767e-4319-bfe9-5fd80b40b8df",
      "text": "只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次",
      "sha256": "b1d239266968026fc4ef7041f32af6dabaff05fb624ba424e4693ea98dc124b5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-9203f2af-7d6a-4c2d-a68d-a741234c1d92",
      "source_span_id": "span-75d9c0b7-edfc-41c1-a9ec-e412c1732365",
      "text": "雾线水门外锚柱",
      "sha256": "364a41b7ccb226b487b22c1ca8c19df403c7d951678a34979003acf57e4a072e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-d546b54d-4912-4061-a026-d2e1b741d0ad",
      "source_span_id": "span-71d28e69-f9d7-47bd-90a8-50ee65cf54f6",
      "text": "北潮闸未关闭时响起，原因未解",
      "sha256": "5a1ecc11587f240902b67617d5fcba571f254dc1dff4ddacd9b13321ea989b70"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-dcd10f68-403d-4a3b-96a5-dfa3651370bc",
